<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>Pazzell - Reset Your Password</title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style type="text/css">
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        min-width: 100%;
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        background-color: #0f0f1a;
        color: #F8F9FF;
      }
      a {
        color: #00D9FF;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      p {
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #c8cce0;
      }
      .email-wrapper {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.2);
      }
      .email-header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A1A2E 0%, #16213e 100%);
        padding: 40px 32px 32px;
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.3);
      }
      .brand-name {
        font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Space Grotesk', Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00D9FF, #00E676);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
        color: #00D9FF;
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 0 0 8px;
      }
      .header-tagline {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: rgba(248, 249, 255, 0.5);
        margin: 0;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .accent-bar {
        height: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6C5CE7, #FF6B9D, #FF9F43);
        margin: 0;
      }
      .email-body {
        padding: 40px 32px;
        background-color: #1A1A2E;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #F8F9FF;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .button-container {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 32px 0;
      }
      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6C5CE7, #FF6B9D);
        color: #ffffff !important;
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 16px 40px;
        border-radius: 50px;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }
      .expiry-note {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: rgba(248, 249, 255, 0.4);
        margin-top: -16px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .warning-box {
        background: rgba(255, 107, 157, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 157, 0.25);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }
      .warning-box p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: rgba(248, 249, 255, 0.65);
        margin: 0;
      }
      .warning-box strong {
        color: #FF6B9D;
      }
      .security-note {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: rgba(248, 249, 255, 0.4);
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .link-fallback {
        background: rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.2);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        margin-top: 8px;
      }
      .link-fallback p {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: rgba(248, 249, 255, 0.4);
        margin: 0 0 6px;
      }
      .link-fallback a {
        font-size: 11px;
        color: #6C5CE7;
        word-break: break-all;
      }
      .divider {
        height: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.3), transparent);
        margin: 24px 0;
        border: none;
      }
      .email-footer {
        background-color: #13131f;
        padding: 24px 32px;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.15);
      }
      .footer-brand {
        font-family: 'Fredoka', Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #6C5CE7;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .footer-text {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: rgba(248, 249, 255, 0.3);
        margin: 0;
      }
      .footer-text a {
        color: #00D9FF;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div style="padding: 24px 16px; background-color: #0f0f1a;">
      <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-header">
          <div class="brand-name">Pazzell</div>
          <p class="header-tagline">Play Puzzles &bull; Win Prizes &bull; Earn Money</p>
        </div>
        <div class="accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="email-body">
          <p class="greeting">Hey <%= user.name %> 👋</p>
          <p>
            We received a request to reset your <strong style="color: #F8F9FF;">Pazzell</strong> account password.
            Click the button below to create a new one:
          </p>

          <div class="button-container">
            <a href="<%= resetLink %>" class="button">Reset My Password</a>
          </div>

          <p class="expiry-note">⏱ This link expires in <strong style="color: #FFEAA7;">15 minutes</strong></p>

          <hr class="divider" />

          <div class="warning-box">
            <p>
              <strong>Security Notice:</strong> If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email.
              Your password will remain unchanged and your account is safe.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="security-note">
            🔒 For your security, never share this link with anyone. The Pazzell team will never ask you for it.
          </p>

          <div class="link-fallback">
            <p>If the button doesn't work, paste this link into your browser:</p>
            <a href="<%= resetLink %>"><%= resetLink %></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="email-footer">
          <div class="footer-brand">Pazzell</div>
          <p class="footer-text">
            Questions? Reach us at
            <a href="mailto:support@pazzell.com">support@pazzell.com</a>
          </p>
          <p class="footer-text" style="margin-top: 6px;">
            &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Pazzell. All rights reserved.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
